  {
    "id": "aprilaire-e070-crawl-space",
    "name": "AprilAire E070 70 Pint Dehumidifier",
    "category": "70 PPD at 80°F/60%, 53 at 73°F, 12.5 x 12.5 x 25 Inches, 8-Inch Collars",
    "badge": "Best Low-Profile Ducted",
    "amazonUrl": "#",
    "pros": [
      "12.5 inches square, one of the easiest ducted units to get through a small hatch",
      "Published 53 pints per day at 73°F as well as 70 at 80°F",
      "8-inch duct collars, washable MERV 8 filter and 10 feet of drain tubing",
